---Probability that a craft will yield one additional product. Also applies to bonus crafts caused by productivity.
---
---[View Documentation](https://lua-api.factorio.com/latest/types/ItemProductPrototype.html%23extra_count_fraction#extra_count_fraction)
---@field extra_count_fraction? float
---@
---
---Amount that should be deducted from any productivity induced bonus crafts.
---
---This value can safely be set larger than the maximum expected craft amount, any excess is ignored.
---
---This value is ignored when [allow\_productivity](https://lua-api.factorio.com/latest/prototypes/RecipePrototype.html%23allow_productivity#allow_productivity) is `false`.
---
---[View Documentation](https://lua-api.factorio.com/latest/types/ItemProductPrototype.html%23ignored_by_productivity#ignored_by_productivity)
---@field ignored_by_productivity? uint16
---@
---
---Amount that should not be included in the item production statistics, typically with a matching ingredient having the same amount set as [ignored\_by\_stats](https://lua-api.factorio.com/latest/types/ItemIngredientPrototype.html%23ignored_by_stats#ignored_by_stats).
---
---If `ignored_by_stats` is larger than the amount crafted (for instance due to probability) it will instead show as consumed.
---
---Products with `ignored_by_stats` defined will not be set as recipe through the circuit network when using the product's item-signal.
---
---[View Documentation](https://lua-api.factorio.com/latest/types/ItemProductPrototype.html%23ignored_by_stats#ignored_by_stats)
